{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2022-06", "window": 2, "start_date": 1654646400, "end_date": 1655337599, "month_true_total": 238, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:01:48 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "117043757", "author": {"steamid": "76561198090258407", "personaname": "Ouroboros", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198090258407/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 1284, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 354, "last_played": 1688953059, "avatar": "c44d876fe156cecb25fffbabb1b5781871978761"}, "language": "english", "review": "Must play Warhammer game! i played this back on the Xbox and ps3 days and cannot believe how well it still holds up to this day, hopefully space marine 2 finds a larger player base and has some sweet mp like this did back then!", "timestamp_created": 1655329693, "timestamp_updated": 1655329693, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "117040377", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971418309", "personaname": "adrenalinda", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/adrenalinda/", "num_games_owned": 297, "num_reviews": 56, "playtime_forever": 2415, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2415, "last_played": 1655163016, "avatar": "dece3b26ef6bc080dc08fc65e46f452910a96c98"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is old, looks old, feels old and at least for me had some retro flashes (never played it before). Predefined paths, limited range of weapons, small variety of enemies and a quite simple story. I believe back in time it was carefully crafted and must fit somewhere into the Warhammer universe (which I do not know at all). It has its own charm and though the orks got me a couple of times, it was quite easy also on the hardest level. Loved the ranged weapons vs. melee options, although the controls feel quite clunky (wait for animation to end before you can trigger a new movement etc.). If it's your world and you don't mind spending a couple of bucks on this, you'll enjoy it as I did.", "timestamp_created": 1655324672, "timestamp_updated": 1655324672, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "117040052", "author": {"steamid": "76561199021600156", "personaname": "ElegantKnave", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199021600156/", "num_games_owned": 198, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 2280, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 702, "last_played": 1725219688, "avatar": "fa2504149fb4bee72ee6061ac8edf09aea6d5598"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awesome game, but a shame GW raised the price to a new AAA game. however if the game is on sale its definite buy.", "timestamp_created": 1655324217, "timestamp_updated": 1655324217, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "117037484", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972344428", "personaname": "John Doe", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197972344428/", "num_games_owned": 361, "num_reviews": 140, "playtime_forever": 1493, "playtime_las